\section{Imports}

We need [[datetime]] for timestamp parsing and [[LearnlogRepo]]
for type annotations in docstrings---the functions accept a repo
instance but do not construct one.

The recorder owns the commit format, so the field names and the
trailer keyword come from \cref{gitrepo} rather than being spelled
out a second time here.

<<commits imports>>=
from __future__ import annotations

import datetime

from learnlog.gitrepo import (
    LearnlogRepo,
    REVIEW_SUBCOMMANDS,
    RUN_ID_FIELD,
    TRAILER_PREFIX,
    VIEWED_FIELD,
)
